OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds without water due to
OL,4,Aburst main
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people are having to use
OL,7,Fbottled water in a West Sussex town
OL,8,Fafter a water main burst.
OL,10,FSouth East Water apologised to
OL,11,Fcustomers in Hassocks, but insisted it
OL,12,Fwas making "good progress" with the
OL,13,Fleak, which was spotted on Friday
OL,14,Fnight.
OL,16,FThe firm dubbed the work "complex"
OL,17,Fbecause it was on a bend and the
OL,18,Fcondition of the ground was
OL,19,F"difficult".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
